<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Unispin slips into yr loss, no div.</title>
<headline>Unispin slips into yr loss, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     0.9 loss    vs    18.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   2.74 loss   vs    10.47</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.52 loss   vs    25.09</p>
<p>    Tax			 nil	   vs    2.19</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   6.16	  vs    1.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		  237.68	vs    258.67</p>
<p>Full name: Unispin Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it continued to be adversely affected by depressed local market conditions and the impact of illegal imports. The increase in net interest paid was due to a capital investment programme which had been completed and would begin operation from next year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
